===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|uproar|ious}} (a variant of {{m|en|-ous|t={{glossary|suffix}} forming {{glossary|adjective}}s from {{glossary|noun}}s, to denote possession or presence of a quality in any degree, commonly in abundance}}).<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=adj|id=220111|date=December 2021|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=adj}}</ref>

